            <Placemark id="978">
                <name>Bamberg Main Station </name>
                <description>
                category  : Get in_By train &lt;br&gt;
                address  :   &lt;br&gt;
                url  : http://www.stationsdatenbank.bayern-takt.de/StationsdatenbankBEG/Steckbrief.html?lang &lt;br&gt;
                description  : Deutsche Bahn (or DB) serves Bamberg with a dependable train service. Frequent trains run from/to [[Nuremberg]] (twice an hour by regional express; 40 min), [[Wurzburg]] (twice an hour; 55–70 min), and [[Bayreuth]] (once every two hours; 70 min). ICE high-speed trains from [[Munich]] (1 hr 45 min), [[Berlin]] (2 hr 45 min) call here at least every second hour, also linking Bamberg with Erfurt (45 min) and Leipzig (1 hr 30 min). Several times a day, there is even a direct train from [[Hamburg]] (4 hr 40 min). From Frankfurt, there is a relatively slow regional express connection every other hour (taking 3 hr) or you may take the ICE and change trains in Würzburg (2 hr 10 min–2 hr 30 min). See [http://www.bahn.de Deutsche Bahn's website] for more information. &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
                <styleUrl>#134</styleUrl>
                <Point id="977">
                    <coordinates>10.8994,49.9008,0.0</coordinates>
                </Point>
            </Placemark>
